(text "NOTES:" (at 20.32 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 4936857b-d327-5bb2-8a8b-21ad39b798f0))
(text "J30 is the outside-world HDMI jack. The retired Intehill controller is a bench-test/fallback fixture, not motherboard circuitry." (at 20.32 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid cfdde52a-ec26-54e5-838c-fe3a44e03db5))
(text "TMDS ESD uses 0.15pF-max, +/-3.6V TPD1E0B04DPLR single-line parts; route each shunt at J30 with no stub." (at 20.32 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 985c6faf-7438-577d-ba41-c01392fbf09c))
(text "CEC and utility are explicitly NC; unused TPD13S523 legacy channels use the datasheet 75R-to-GND termination." (at 20.32 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 36f74a2c-18bd-583d-9fb4-9a62501e8575))
(text "U54/U55 remove 5V/DDC/HPD power while the Mu is off; PCA9306 translates DDC/SCDC and U53 buffers HPD." (at 20.32 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid d704e2c5-145b-569f-a94b-daec1b8d3e4b))
(text "LAYOUT: HDMI TMDS pairs are 100-ohm differential. Match pair skew to under 5 mil per Mu HDMI guide (current ~495 mil)." (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 8269cdee-28f1-59c6-be0d-82aa43e34905))
(text "LAYOUT: PCIe Gen3 pairs are 85-ohm differential. Match data-pair skew under 5 mil and refclock under 5 mil per Mu PCIe guide." (at 20.32 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid d245f99b-3c24-5e40-aabf-d24c52f714bc))
(text "Release gate: verify >=4.8V at J30 pin 18 under 55mA and validate the finished HDMI 2.0 layout on hardware." (at 20.32 281.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 0a95c609-6dbc-5208-8aaf-10b2e4bcf874))
